# Heavy Fab Modern_City_Environment staging files (~1.6 GB total) are NOT versioned.
# Only the import helper scripts (.py/.js) and the geometry-only GLB splits
# (splits_geo/) are committed so the .uassets can be reproduced on a fresh checkout.
FabCity/*/*.gltf
FabCity/*/*.bin
FabCity/*/*.glb
FabCity/*/*.blend
FabCity/*/textures/
FabCity/*/*.json
FabCity/*/splits/